---
// Lynik Innovations — Services (concept mockup)
import './pharm-consult.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Lynik Innovations — Services (Concept)</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap"
  />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">

    <header class="nav">
      <div class="wrap nav-row">
        <div class="wordmark-row">
          <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
          <div class="wordmark">
            <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
            <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/">Home</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about/">About</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services/" class="active">Services</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help/">Who We Help</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="btn btn-gold nav-cta">Let's Talk</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="wrap hero-row">
        <div class="hero">
          <span class="eyebrow">SERVICES</span>
          <h1>Experienced. Practical.<br/>Ready to Step In.</h1>
          <p class="lede2">Lynik Innovations brings practical pharmaceutical Medical Information experience combined with scientific expertise and operational leadership.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-media">
          <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — desk, laptop, LKI mug</span></div>
          <div class="hero-caption">
            Your goals.<br/>Our expertise.<br/>Real solutions.
            <div class="rule"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="center" style="max-width:100%">Our Services</h2>
        <p class="lede center" style="margin-inline:auto">Tailored support for your Medical Information and Medical Affairs needs.</p>
        <div class="rule" style="margin-inline:auto"></div>

        <div class="card-grid cols-4" style="margin-top:40px">

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — office, laptop</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M3 21c0-3 2-4.7 5-4.7S13 18 13 21M13 21c0-3 2-4.7 5-4.7S23 18 23 21" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Medical Information Leadership (Interim MI Team)</h3>
              <p>Experienced guidance for organizations establishing, expanding, or optimizing their Medical Information function &mdash; without immediately hiring a permanent employee. Support and coordinates:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Medical Information strategy</li>
                <li>Operational planning</li>
                <li>Process and workflow development</li>
                <li>Governance</li>
                <li>Team structure and readiness</li>
                <li>Vendor and contact-center oversight</li>
                <li>Performance monitoring</li>
                <li>Cross-functional collaboration</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — launch document</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none"><path d="M15 4c4 3 6 7.5 6 12.5 0 2-.4 3.6-1 5H10c-.6-1.4-1-3-1-5C9 11.5 11 7 15 4z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="15" cy="13" r="2.4" fill="var(--sage)"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Launch Readiness</h3>
              <p>We support companies in preparing their Medical Information function before and during product launch, including:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Medical Information resource planning</li>
                <li>FAQ development</li>
                <li>Standard response resources</li>
                <li>Inquiry management workflows</li>
                <li>Escalation processes</li>
                <li>Contact center readiness</li>
                <li>Training and metrics/reporting</li>
                <li>Pre-launch MI planning and support</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — books, plant</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 4h9l4 4v12H6z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h6" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Medical Information Content</h3>
              <p>We develop and maintain scientifically accurate, balanced, compliant Medical Information resources.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Standard response documents &amp; FAQs</li>
                <li>Custom response frameworks</li>
                <li>Scientific literature searches</li>
                <li>Literature summaries</li>
                <li>Content lifecycle management</li>
                <li>Content review and updates</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — laptop, notebook</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4h16v13H8l-4 4z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Inquiry &amp; Escalation Support</h3>
              <p>Complex Medical Information inquiries require thoughtful scientific assessment and appropriate escalation. We can establish or strengthen:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Inquiry triage</li>
                <li>Escalation pathways</li>
                <li>Complex inquiry management</li>
                <li>Scientific response development</li>
                <li>Third-party contact center guidance</li>
                <li>Response quality processes</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — clipboard, stethoscope</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 3v3a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2V3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M7 5H5v16h14V5h-2" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Medical Review Support</h3>
              <p>Medical Information and Medical Affairs frequently intersect with medical review activities. Lynik provides support related to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Medical review workflows</li>
                <li>Scientific &amp; medical content review</li>
                <li>Cross-functional review processes</li>
                <li>Review readiness</li>
                <li>Coordination with Medical Affairs</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — charts, pen</span></div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none"><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="6.5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M13 3v3M13 20v3M3 13h3M20 13h3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Process Improvement &amp; Operations</h3>
              <p>We evaluate existing processes and identify opportunities to improve:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Workflow efficiency &amp; response timelines</li>
                <li>Quality processes &amp; documentation</li>
                <li>Training &amp; metrics</li>
                <li>Knowledge management</li>
                <li>Resource utilization</li>
                <li>Vendor operations</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card">
            <div class="thumb">
              <div class="photo-block" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--forest) 0%,var(--forest-2) 100%)">
                <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1.2" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M12 3v5M12 16v5M3 12h5M16 12h5" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                <span class="cap" style="color:var(--sage)">AI network illustration</span>
              </div>
              <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1.2" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 3v5M12 16v5M3 12h5M16 12h5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>AI-Enabled Medical Information</h3>
              <p>Practical, human-overseen AI adoption for Medical Information teams:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>AI literature-search templates</li>
                <li>AI prompt development</li>
                <li>Literature evaluation training</li>
                <li>AI-assisted scientific summarization</li>
                <li>Human verification &amp; oversight frameworks</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="learn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ad-card">
            <h3>The right expertise.<br/>At the right time.</h3>
            <p>Let's build a solution that works for you.</p>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="btn btn-gold" style="align-self:flex-start;margin-top:6px">Contact Us</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark">
      <div class="wrap band-cta">
        <div class="left">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">READY TO GET STARTED?</span>
          <h2>Let's Talk About Your Next Step.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mid">
          <p>Whether you need interim MI leadership, launch support, content development, AI enablement, or process improvement, Lynik Innovations is here to help.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="footer-top">
          <div class="wordmark-row">
            <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
            <div class="wordmark">
              <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
              <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <nav class="footer-nav">
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/">Home</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about/">About</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services/">Services</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help/">Who We Help</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact/">Contact</a>
          </nav>
          <div class="footer-contact">
            <span>info@lynikinnovations.com</span>
            <div class="social">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="3" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="7.2" cy="7.2" r="1.1" fill="rgba(247,245,239,.7)"/><path d="M6.2 10.5v7.3M10.4 10.5v7.3M10.4 13.6c0-1.8 1.2-3.1 2.9-3.1s2.7 1.1 2.7 3.3v4" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
          <span>&copy; 2026 Lynik Innovations. All rights reserved.</span>
          <span>Madison, Wisconsin</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>